lock
faceplayer
msgbox	TEAM AQUA's actions should bring smiles to people's faces!
applymovement VAR_LAST_TALKED Common_Movement_FaceOriginalDirection
waitmovement 0
release
end
= Route110_EventScript_AquaGrunt3
lock
faceplayer
msgbox	This is my first job after joining TEAM AQUA. It's a little scary.
applymovement VAR_LAST_TALKED Common_Movement_FaceOriginalDirection
waitmovement 0
