lock
faceplayer
msgbox	TEAM AQUA's activities… We can't talk about them yet.
applymovement VAR_LAST_TALKED Common_Movement_FaceOriginalDirection
waitmovement 0
release
end
= Route110_EventScript_ChallengeGuy
lock
faceplayer
specialvar VAR_RESULT GetPlayerAvatarBike
goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT 1 Route110_EventScript_PlayerRidingAcroBike
goto_if_eq VAR_CYCLING_CHALLENGE_STATE 0 Route110_EventScript_PlayerNotRidingBike
msgbox	Regardless of the results, I count on seeing more challenges from you. Always aim higher!
release
end
= Route110_EventScript_PlayerNotRidingBike
msgbox	This is CYCLING ROAD.If you were to ride from MAUVILLE to SLATEPORT on a MACH BIKE, you would be rated for the number of collisions and your total time.
release
end
= Route110_EventScript_PlayerRidingAcroBike
msgbox	On this CYCLING ROAD, those riding MACH BIKES are rated for their number of collisions and their total times.ACRO BIKES do not qualify for rating. They are easy to turn, so it's not fair.
release
end
= Route110_EventScript_Dale
trainerbattle_single TRAINER_DALE Route110_Text_DaleIntro Route110_Text_DaleDefeated
msgbox	Route110_Text_DalePostBattle
end
= Route110_EventScript_Edwin
trainerbattle_single TRAINER_EDWIN_1 Route110_Text_EdwinIntro Route110_Text_EdwinDefeated Route110_EventScript_EdwinRegisterMatchCallAfterBattle
